{
  // 實機裝置設定範例 / Sample real-device settings.
  //
  // 用法 / How to use:
  // 把本檔複製成執行檔旁的 device.json 並填入現場數值。切換不需要重新編譯。
  // device.json 存在 → 依內容接實機；不存在 → 程式拒絕啟動,並顯示它找過的路徑。
  // 不會退回模擬 —— 模擬判定與實機結果在畫面上分不出來,不該由「檔案漏放」觸發。
  // 沒有裝置而只想看畫面時,以 --mock 啟動（標題列會標示,判定非量測結果）。
  // Copy this to device.json next to the executable and fill in the line's values; no rebuild.
  // Present → the real devices named here; absent → the program refuses to start and shows the
  // path it searched. It does not fall back to mocks: mock verdicts are indistinguishable from
  // real ones on screen and must not be triggered by a misplaced file. To view the UI with no
  // devices, start with --mock (the title bar says so, and the verdicts are not measurements).
  //
  // 兩台裝置各自獨立 / The two devices are independent:
  // CodeReader（SR-X300 讀碼器）必填。
  // CharacterVerifier（IV4 字符檢測）在還沒導入時「整段刪掉」，不要留一段空的。
  //   此時配方的字符區域數要設為 0，否則每張標籤都會以「區域數不足」判退。
  // CodeReader is required. Delete the whole CharacterVerifier section while there is no IV4 yet
  // rather than leaving an empty one; the recipe's region count must then be 0, or every label
  // rejects on the region count.
  //
  // 怎麼確認欄位索引 / How to confirm the field indexes:
  // 按一次「單次觸發」，操作訊息區會出現「電文 / frame [裝置名稱]: ...」，那是裝置送回來的
  // 原始字串。數一數它的欄位（由 0 起算），再把索引對上去。兩台裝置各有自己的一行。
  // 設定錯誤的表徵是「每張標籤都判退」，那與印刷不良、與感測器沒對焦看起來一模一樣，
  // 所以請一定先看電文再調索引，不要憑判定結果猜。
  // Press Trigger once and the log pane shows "電文 / frame [device]: ..." — the raw string the
  // device sent, one line per device. Count its fields (zero-based) and match the indexes. A wrong
  // layout presents as "every label rejects", which looks exactly like bad print and exactly like
  // a sensor out of focus, so read the frame first rather than guessing from the verdicts.

  // ── 兩站相隔幾格 / Pitches between the two stations ──
  //
  // 讀碼站到字符檢測站之間，標籤要前進幾格。機構是「先 SR-X300 掃碼，再前進、再觸發 IV4」，
  // 所以正常值為正；兩台瞄同一個位置時填 0。
  // How many pitches a label advances from the reading station to the verification station. The
  // mechanism scans on the SR-X300, advances, then triggers the IV4, so the normal value is positive;
  // use 0 when both sensors look at the same position.
  //
  // 填錯的後果不是「跑不動」，而是追溯紀錄把讀碼站看到的第 N 張與檢測站看到的第 N−k 張
  // 湊成一筆 —— 不會報錯、良率正常、每一筆看起來都完整，但兩半不屬於同一張標籤。
  // 這是這支程式能造成的最嚴重錯誤，請務必照實際機構填。
  // A wrong value does not stop the machine: it pairs the reading station's label N with the
  // verification station's label N−k in one record. Nothing errors, the yield looks normal and every
  // row looks complete, while the two halves belong to different labels. This is the worst thing this
  // program can do, so set it from the actual mechanism.
  //
  // 現場會看到的行為：初始化後前 k 次觸發只掃碼、不產生紀錄，訊息區顯示「標籤前進中」，
  // 第 k+1 次才出現第一筆判定。停機時兩站之間那 k 張會被作廢並在訊息區報出張數。
  // What the line sees: after initialising, the first k triggers only scan and produce no record, the
  // log says the label is advancing, and the first verdict appears on trigger k+1. On a stop the k
  // labels between the stations are voided and their count is reported in the log.
  "InspectionOffsetPitches": 4,

  "CodeReader": {
    // Keyence SR-X300。設定軟體：AutoID Network Navigator → 乙太網頁籤。
    // 讀碼器必須設成 TCP 伺服器；設成客戶端的話它不會在任何埠等待，
    // 症狀是「拒絕連線」且掃不到任何開著的資料埠。
    // Configured from AutoID Network Navigator, Ethernet tab. The reader has to be a TCP server;
    // as a client it listens on nothing, and the symptom is a refused connection with no data port
    // open anywhere.
    "Host": "192.168.1.10",

    // 埠號在乙太網頁籤的「設定小幫手」或「設定清單」裡，不在 IP 設定那一頁。
    // 改完記得按「設定傳送」寫進讀碼器，否則實機行為不會變。
    // The port lives in the Ethernet tab's setup wizard or parameter list, not on the IP page.
    // Remember to transmit the settings to the reader afterwards or nothing changes on the device.
    "Port": 9004,

    // 觸發命令，不含結束字元。沒有預設值 —— 請照裝置通訊規格書填，程式無從猜測。
    // 命令錯誤的表徵是「裝置完全不回應」，與網路不通、與裝置沒開機分不出來。
    // Trigger command without its terminator. No default: take it from the device's communication
    // spec, because the program cannot guess. A wrong command presents as "the device never
    // answers", indistinguishable from a dead link or an unpowered device.
    "TriggerCommand": "LON",

    // Cr / Lf / CrLf。實機為 CR,見設定軟體「終端」欄。
    // The hardware uses CR; see the Terminator row in the setup software.
    "Terminator": "Cr",

    // 分隔符（附加數據）—— 條碼與其附加資料之間。實機為冒號。
    // The appended-data delimiter, between a code and its appended items. The hardware uses a colon.
    "FieldDelimiter": ":",

    "ConnectTimeoutMs": 5000,

    // 要比協調器的讀碼逾時（預設 3 秒）明顯短。兩層逾時同時到期時，
    // 現場會隨機拿到兩種訊息之一，而只有裝置層那句說得出是哪一台沒回應。
    // Keep this comfortably shorter than the sequencer's 3-second read timeout: when both expire
    // together the line gets one of two messages at random, and only the device-level one names
    // the device that went silent.
    "ResponseTimeoutMs": 2000,

    // 以此開頭的電文視為裝置自身異常 → 停線，不會被記成一張不良標籤。
    // A frame starting with this is a device-level fault: stop the line, do not log a bad label.
    "ErrorPrefix": "ER",

    // 視為「該欄位沒有結果」的字樣，不分大小寫。空欄位一律視為沒有結果。
    // 讀不到的那一筆會落在這裡，於是不進結果清單，改由配方的筆數檢查判退 —— 那是漏貼標籤
    // 唯一會被抓到的地方。請用實機量一次「讀不到」的電文再確認這份清單。
    // Tokens meaning "no result in this field", case-insensitive; an empty field always counts. A failed
    // read lands here, stays out of the result list, and is rejected by the recipe's count check — the one
    // place a missing label is caught. Confirm this list against a real no-read frame.
    //
    // 注意：若讀不到時輸出的字樣以 ErrorPrefix 開頭（例如 "ERROR" 之於 "ER"），
    // 一張漏貼的標籤會被當成設備異常而停線。那時要把 ErrorPrefix 設為 ""（停用），
    // 並把該字樣列進本清單。
    // Careful: if the no-read token starts with ErrorPrefix — "ERROR" against "ER", say — one missing label
    // stops the line as an equipment fault. Set ErrorPrefix to "" to disable that check and list the token
    // here instead.
    "EmptyTokens": ["NG", "NOREAD", "----"],

    // ── 電文結構 / Frame structure ──
    //
    // 實機格式（AutoID Terminal 擷取）/ As captured from the hardware:
    //   2132030090A0S6X10683:-0.0,2132030090A0S6X10685:3.0,2132030090A0S6X10684:3.0[CR]
    //   └───── 一筆記錄 ──────┘  └───── 一筆記錄 ─────┘
    //        碼    :    等級      ↑ 記錄分隔符 / record delimiter
    //
    // 對應設定軟體「操作模式 → 數據編輯 → 讀取數據格式」那一頁：
    //   分隔符（附加數據）      → FieldDelimiter
    //   內部分隔符（讀取多個代碼）→ RecordDelimiter
    // These map to the reader's own Read data format page: the appended-data delimiter is
    // FieldDelimiter and the inter-code delimiter is RecordDelimiter.
    //
    // 兩者不可相同。填成同一個字元,兩層會塌成一層 —— 碼與等級被當成兩筆條碼,
    // 筆數變成兩倍,而等級整批消失。程式在啟動時會擋下這種設定。
    // They must differ: one character for both collapses the two levels, a code and its grade become two
    // codes, the count doubles and every grade disappears. The program refuses this at startup.
    "RecordDelimiter": ",",

    // 一筆記錄裡條碼的位置。報頭設為「無」時條碼在最前面,所以是 0。
    // Position of the code within one record. With the header set to none it comes first, so zero.
    "CodeField": 0,

    // 一筆記錄裡品質等級的位置；不讀等級時填 null。
    // 附加數據勾選 ISO/IEC 15415（二維）或 15416（一維）後,等級就排在條碼之後那一格。
    // 兩項可以同時勾選以兼容不同條碼類型,但一次讀取只會輸出其中一種,所以位置固定為 1。
    // Position of the quality grade within one record, or null to read none. With ISO/IEC 15415 (2D) or
    // 15416 (1D) ticked in the appended data, the grade sits in the field after the code. Both may be
    // ticked to cover different symbol types, yet one read emits only one of them, so the position is 1.
    //
    // 等級必須設成「數值」輸出,不能用字母。字母（A/B/C/D）無法與配方的整數門檻比較,
    // 解析後為 null,配方若啟用等級檢查會判退「未輸出品質等級」。
    // The grade has to be configured as numeric output rather than letters: letters cannot be compared with
    // the recipe's integer threshold, parse to null, and make a recipe with grade checking enabled reject
    // with "no grade reported".
    //
    // 實測輸出帶小數位（"3.0"),程式會向下取整;「未評估」輸出 -0.0,程式視為「沒有等級」
    // 而非「等級 0」—— 0 在 ISO 刻度上是最差的合格等級,兩者判退原因不同。
    // The hardware emits a decimal place ("3.0") and the program floors it. Not-evaluated comes back as
    // -0.0, which the program treats as no grade rather than grade zero: zero is the worst *valid* grade on
    // the ISO scale, and the two reject for different reasons.
    "GradeField": 1
  },

  // ── 以下這一段在 IV4 導入之前請整段刪除 / Delete this whole section until the IV4 arrives ──
  "CharacterVerifier": {
    // Keyence IV4。與讀碼器是不同的裝置，位址、埠、命令、欄位全部各自獨立設定。
    // 不可與 CodeReader 填同一個位址加埠 —— 那幾乎一定是複製後忘了改，
    // 而多數工業裝置只接受一條連線，結果會是其中一台在初始化時被拒絕。
    // A different device from the reader, with its own address, port, command and fields. It must
    // not share an address and port with CodeReader: that is almost always an unedited copy, and
    // since most industrial devices accept only one link, one of them is refused at initialise.
    "Host": "192.168.1.11",
    "Port": 8500,
    "TriggerCommand": "T1",
    "Terminator": "Cr",
    "FieldDelimiter": ",",
    "ConnectTimeoutMs": 5000,
    "ResponseTimeoutMs": 2000,
    "ErrorPrefix": "ER",
    "EmptyTokens": ["NG", "NOREAD", "----"],

    // 字符檢測各區域文字所在欄位。筆數要與配方的 ExpectedCharacterRegionCount 一致。
    // 不可為空 —— 還沒有 IV4 的話請把整個 CharacterVerifier 段落刪掉，而不是留空陣列。
    // Fields holding each OCR region's text; the count should match the recipe's
    // ExpectedCharacterRegionCount. It must not be empty: with no IV4 yet, delete the whole
    // CharacterVerifier section rather than leaving an empty array.
    "CharacterTextFields": [1, 2]
  }
}
